			"notes": "### 安装 / Installation\n\n- Minecraft 1.20.1 + Forge 47.4.10+\n- 客户端需 Modern UI `3.12.0.1` 与 Kotlin for Forge,TaCZ 等为可选联动\n- 将本页附件 `fpsmatch-1.26.9.19.jar` 放入 `.minecraft/mods/`\n\n### 链接 / Links\n\n- 文档 / Docs: https://fpsmatch.ptcrys.net/master/\n- Maven: `net.ptcrys:fpsmatch:1.26.9.19` · https://maven.ptcrys.net/releases\n\n### 反馈 / Feedback\n\n- [Issues](https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/issues)\n- [README](https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch#readme)\n- QQ 群：771884981\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Re master by @LeeQianXi in https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/pull/35\n* docs: rebuild developer and mapper wiki by @SSOrangeCATY in https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/pull/36\n* docs: refresh mapper wiki and update homepage by @SSOrangeCATY in https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/pull/37\n* Ci by @LeeQianXi in https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/pull/38\n\n## New Contributors\n* @LeeQianXi made their first contribution in https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/pull/35\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PhasetransCrystal/FPSMatch/compare/fpsmatch-1.20.1-1.3.0-forge-snapshot-20260916-1623...v1.26.9.19"
